@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login (ajustar credenciales de prueba)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/SGR/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "residente@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe!"
}

### GET detalle ticket propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET comentarios (filtrados por rol)
GET {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST comentario público
POST {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comentario": "Seguimiento desde prueba HTTP",
  "esInterno": false
}

### POST comentario interno (solo admin — usar token admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1/comentarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comentario": "Nota interna admin",
  "esInterno": true
}

### GET ticket ajeno (esperado 404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Admin CRUD (token administrador) ---

### POST crear ticket en nombre de residente
POST {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioSolicitanteId": 2,
  "titulo": "Alta admin HTTP",
  "descripcion": "Creado desde prueba",
  "categoria": "Plomería",
  "prioridad": "Media"
}

### PATCH metadatos admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Título editado",
  "descripcion": "Descripción editada",
  "categoria": "Plomería",
  "prioridad": "Alta"
}

### DELETE soft delete admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/TKT/Tickets/1/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Catálogos admin ---

### GET prioridades
GET {{baseUrl}}/TKT/PrioridadesTicket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST categoría admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/TKT/CategoriasTicket/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Electricidad"
}

### PUT categoría admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/TKT/CategoriasTicket/1/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Plomería actualizada"
}

### DELETE categoría admin (409 si hay tickets)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/TKT/CategoriasTicket/99/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST prioridad admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/TKT/PrioridadesTicket/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Urgente",
  "orden": 1
}
